WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.189
"Don't worry, Cow," said Bat.

2
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.002
"I can fly.

3
00:00:11.003 --> 00:00:15.392
I will look for your hula hoop!"

4
00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:30.930
Bat flew to the tree.

5
00:00:30.931 --> 00:00:39.209
He flew to the tractor.

6
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:49.071
"Do you see it?" asked Cow.

7
00:00:49.072 --> 00:00:51.532
"No," said Bat.

8
00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:55.464
"But I will find it soon."

9
00:00:55.465 --> 00:01:14.770
Bat looked in the hammock.

10
00:01:14.771 --> 00:01:32.393
He looked near Farmer's house.

11
00:01:32.394 --> 00:01:42.310
He did not see the hula hoop.

12
00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:51.827
He did not see it anywhere.

13
00:01:51.828 --> 00:01:59.815
But Bat saw Farmer's wife.

14
00:01:59.816 --> 00:02:03.806
"Farmer!" she called.

15
00:02:03.807 --> 00:02:10.485
"Where are you?"

16
00:02:10.486 --> 00:02:13.493
"Hmm . . . ," said Bat.

17
00:02:13.494 --> 00:02:17.539
"Cow's hula hoop is missing," said Bat.

18
00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:21.169
"And Farmer is missing.

19
00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:27.557
So maybe . . ."

20
00:02:27.558 --> 00:02:44.994
"Farmer took Cow's hula hoop!" said Bat.

21
00:02:44.995 --> 00:02:48.724
"Thank you, Bat," said Cow.

22
00:02:48.725 --> 00:02:52.021
"You found my hula hoop!"

23
00:02:52.022 --> 00:02:57.740
"Farmer's wife is happy too," said Cat.

24
00:02:57.741 --> 00:03:01.386
"Farmer is not being lazy now."

25
00:03:01.387 --> 00:03:07.327
"Look at him go!" said Cow.

26
00:03:07.328 --> 00:03:17.127
"Farmer is good at hooping," said Bat.

27
00:03:17.128 --> 00:03:23.916
"But Cow is better."

